OL,3,GNEWSAMPs jostle for slice of #14.6m
OL,4,Afrom axed leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Bradford West MP Naz Shah
OL,7,Fhas recently said the cash should stay
OL,8,Fin the constituency it was meant for:
OL,9,F"This money is something that I secured
OL,10,Ffor Bradford West, and I'd like to keep
OL,11,Fit in Bradford West."
